# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxfixes
pkgver=6.0.1
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X11 miscellaneous fixes extension library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libx11)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libXfixes-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('b695f93cd2499421ab02d22744458e650ccc88c1d4c8130d60200213abc02d58')

build() {
    cd libXfixes-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd libXfixes-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
